## Broadcaster

```elixir
Rclex.start_node("livebook_broadcaster")
:ok = Rclex.tf2_start_broadcaster("livebook_broadcaster")

# A static transform: world -> robot at (1, 2, 0), no rotation.
ts = %Rclex.Pkgs.GeometryMsgs.Msg.TransformStamped{
  header: %Rclex.Pkgs.StdMsgs.Msg.Header{
    stamp: %Rclex.Pkgs.BuiltinInterfaces.Msg.Time{sec: 0, nanosec: 0},
    frame_id: "world"
  },
  child_frame_id: "robot",
  transform: %Rclex.Pkgs.GeometryMsgs.Msg.Transform{
    translation: %Rclex.Pkgs.GeometryMsgs.Msg.Vector3{x: 1.0, y: 2.0, z: 0.0},
    rotation: %Rclex.Pkgs.GeometryMsgs.Msg.Quaternion{x: 0.0, y: 0.0, z: 0.0, w: 1.0}
  }
}

:ok = Rclex.tf2_broadcast_static(ts, "livebook_broadcaster")
```

